    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Rescue: Tropic Survival takes players to a breathtaking tropical island where survival is the ultimate challenge. After a shipwreck, you are the sole survivor with limited resources. Begin your journey by exploring the lush jungles, scavenging for food, materials, and crafting essential tools. Build a shelter to protect yourself from unpredictable weather and lurking predators while managing your health and hydration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, uncover the island's mysterious secrets\u2014hidden caves, ancient artifacts, and clues pointing to a forgotten civilization. Can you unlock the island's mysteries and escape, or will you become part of its legend forever?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Rescue: Tropic Survival takes players to a breathtaking tropical island where survival is the ultimate challenge. After a shipwreck, you are the sole survivor with limited resources. Begin your journey by exploring the lush jungles, scavenging for food, materials, and crafting essential tools. Build a shelter to protect yourself from unpredictable weather and lurking predators while managing your health and hydration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance, uncover the island's mysterious secrets\u2014hidden caves, ancient artifacts, and clues pointing to a forgotten civilization. Can you unlock the island's mysteries and escape, or will you become part of its legend forever?</p>",
    "short_description": "Island Rescue: Tropic Survival is a survival game where you, the sole survivor of a shipwreck, must navigate a tropical island. Scavenge for resources, build shelter, face wild animals and harsh weather while uncovering ancient secrets of a forgotten civilization, all while seeking a way to escape.",
